
| Method      | Purpose                    |
| ----------- | -------------------------- |
| `keys()`    | Returns all keys           |
| `values()`  | Returns all values         |
| `items()`   | Returns key-value pairs    |
| `get()`     | Safe access                |
| `update()`  | Merge/update dictionary    |
| `pop()`     | Remove a key               |
| `popitem()` | Removes last inserted item |
| `clear()`   | Removes everything         |
| `copy()`    | Creates shallow copy       |
